<section><h2 class="ref-sec-title">In the profiles</h2><ul class="yr-prof"><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/empire/ottoman-empire"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Ottoman%20Empire.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Ottoman Empire</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">The Grand National Assembly abolishes the sultanate</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/empire/venezuela"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Venezuela.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Venezuela</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">The Barroso II blowout reveals the oil riches of Lake Maracaibo</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/empire/united-kingdom-of-great-britain-and-ireland"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/United%20Kingdom%20of%20Great%20Britain%20and%20Ireland.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>United Kingdom of Great Britain and Ireland</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">The Irish Free State is established; Northern Ireland stays in the UK</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/empire/kingdom-of-greece"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Kingdom%20of%20Greece.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Kingdom of Greece</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">Defeat in Asia Minor; Smyrna burns and over a million refugees flee</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/empire/kingdom-of-italy"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Kingdom%20of%20Italy.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Kingdom of Italy</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">The March on Rome brings Benito Mussolini to power</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/empire/russian-sfsr"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Russian%20SFSR.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Russian SFSR</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">The RSFSR co-founds the Soviet Union</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/empire/republic-of-latvia"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Republic%20of%20Latvia.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Republic of Latvia</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">The Satversme is adopted; Jānis Čakste becomes president</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/empire/united-kingdom"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/United%20Kingdom.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>United Kingdom</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">The Irish Free State leaves; Northern Ireland remains in the United Kingdom</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/empire/soviet-union"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Soviet%20Union.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Soviet Union</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">Four Soviet republics form the Union of Soviet Socialist Republics</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/language/hebrew"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Hebrew.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Hebrew</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">The British Mandate for Palestine recognises Hebrew as an official language beside English and Arabic</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/government/dictatorship"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Dictatorship.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Dictatorship</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">Benito Mussolini comes to power in Italy and from 1925 builds the first fascist dictatorship</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/empire/mandatory-palestine"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Mandatory%20Palestine.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Mandatory Palestine</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">The League of Nations grants Britain the Mandate for Palestine; the Palestine Order in Council plans a Legislative Council whose seats the Arabs reject, boycotting the 1923 elections.</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/movement/modernism"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Modernism.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Modernism</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">James Joyce publishes Ulysses</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/movement/zionism"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Zionism.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Zionism</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">The British Mandate for Palestine, based on the Balfour Declaration, makes the Jewish Agency a partner of the mandatory government</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/ideology/fascism"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Fascism.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Fascism</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">After the March on Rome, King Victor Emmanuel III appoints Mussolini Prime Minister of Italy</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/ideology/islamism"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Islamism.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Islamism</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">Rashid Rida begins his treatise “The Caliphate or the Supreme Imamate” in Al-Manar, later a blueprint for Islamist movements</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/empire/republic-of-lithuania-1918-1940"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Republic%20of%20Lithuania%20(1918-1940).png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Republic of Lithuania (1918-1940)</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">Lithuania adopts a final constitution and introduces the litas</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/empire/ukrainian-ssr"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Ukrainian%20SSR.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Ukrainian SSR</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">The Ukrainian SSR joined the Russian, Byelorussian and Transcaucasian republics in founding the USSR</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/work/beowulf"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Beowulf.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Beowulf</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">Frederick Klaeber publishes the edition that becomes the central source for study of the poem</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/work/odyssey"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Odyssey.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Odyssey</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">James Joyce publishes Ulysses, a reworking of the Odyssey set in Dublin</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/empire/armenian-ssr"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Armenian%20SSR.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Armenian SSR</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">Armenia joins Georgia and Azerbaijan in the Transcaucasian SFSR, one of the four founding republics of the Soviet Union</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/empire/second-polish-republic"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Second%20Polish%20Republic.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Second Polish Republic</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">The eastern borders are settled diplomatically and recognised by the League of Nations</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/city/dublin"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Dublin.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Dublin</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">Dublin becomes the capital of the Irish Free State</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/work/tomb-of-tutankhamun"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Tomb%20of%20Tutankhamun.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Tomb of Tutankhamun</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">Howard Carter's excavators found the first step of the entrance staircase and reached the antechamber on 26 November</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/work/kebra-nagast"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Kebra%20Nagast.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Kebra Nagast</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">E. A. Wallis Budge's English translation appears, in the first of two editions</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/life/vladimir-lenin"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Vladimir%20Lenin.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Vladimir Lenin</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">The Soviet Union is formed; Lenin has his first stroke in May</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/movement/new-culture-movement"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/New%20Culture%20Movement.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>New Culture Movement</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">New Culture reformers welcome Margaret Sanger's visit to China, and Hu Shih translates her speech on birth control</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/ideology/syndicalism"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Syndicalism.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Syndicalism</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">The International Workers' Association is formed as an international syndicalist federation</span></li></ul></section>
